{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake up in absolute darkness. There shouldn\u2019t be anyone else in the apartment\u2014but it seems someone or something is watching you\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIs Anybody There?\u201d is a first-person horror in which you are deprived of sight. You\u2019ll flee a mysterious pursuer by navigating the game world with your hearing and echolocation. Solve audio-based puzzles, survive, and immerse yourself in the story through cinematic scenes, flashbacks, and notes. What lies behind the attempt to abduct you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/1804e75569907abdce2d99624a064e33.gif?t=1768965168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/1804e75569907abdce2d99624a064e33.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/f92c92098062b80a8b01c2e48d51ee92.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" width=640 height=107 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/f92c92098062b80a8b01c2e48d51ee92.webm?t=1768965168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/b926205a5c6897454f7c3ef532bb9c95.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/b926205a5c6897454f7c3ef532bb9c95.webm?t=1768965168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE BLIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll step into the role of a blind boy for whom hearing, touch, and imagination have replaced sight\u2014an idea that underscores the game\u2019s unique visual style. Navigate via echolocation, listen to your surroundings and to the dangers lurking in the dark. Feel notes written in Braille that will help you make sense of what\u2019s happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIs Anybody There?\u201d doesn\u2019t waste your time wandering to figure out \u201cwhat to do next.\u201d The game is event-driven, with gameplay situations following one another so you never get bored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/1804e75569907abdce2d99624a064e33.gif?t=1768965168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/1804e75569907abdce2d99624a064e33.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/95a7f24583c7a04a9d1c4cdb2e7b3262.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" width=640 height=107 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/95a7f24583c7a04a9d1c4cdb2e7b3262.webm?t=1768965168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/ef8440a29b94a5da27116af4364342f5.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/ef8440a29b94a5da27116af4364342f5.webm?t=1768965168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRUST YOUR EARS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to spatial audio technology, you\u2019ll hear sounds not only left or right, but even as if someone is breathing down your neck. Sound goes beyond simple positioning: it realistically reflects off surfaces and becomes distorted as it filters through thin barriers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hired professional actors to voice all characters to help you fully immerse in the game\u2019s atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio in this game is not just sound \u2014 it\u2019s the foundation of the gameplay. Most challenges are based on auditory perception, from straightforward navigation to modest puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/1804e75569907abdce2d99624a064e33.gif?t=1768965168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/1804e75569907abdce2d99624a064e33.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/cda5604726539e64fd1c0fbcc48b463c.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" width=640 height=107 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/cda5604726539e64fd1c0fbcc48b463c.webm?t=1768965168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/133a9a57ec04da7844c6a7e689e1c69a.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/133a9a57ec04da7844c6a7e689e1c69a.webm?t=1768965168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HE\u2019S NEARBY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the dark. The antagonist is always close and SEES you. He can catch you at any moment\u2026 but he doesn\u2019t rush. He wants to play, to frighten you, to break you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect intense chase sequences that will test your spatial awareness and your hearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings: your first playthrough won\u2019t be the last \u2014 pay attention to unlock the alternate ending. Can you stand up to the stalker?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/1804e75569907abdce2d99624a064e33.gif?t=1768965168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/1804e75569907abdce2d99624a064e33.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYTIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is Anybody There? is a short but tightly packed horror experience \u2014 a full playthrough takes about 60\u2013120 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymo