ll help you make sense of what\u2019s happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIs Anybody There?\u201d doesn\u2019t waste your time wandering to figure out \u201cwhat to do next.\u201d The game is event-driven, with gameplay situations following one another so you never get bored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/1804e75569907abdce2d99624a064e33.gif?t=1768965168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/1804e75569907abdce2d99624a064e33.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/95a7f24583c7a04a9d1c4cdb2e7b3262.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" width=640 height=107 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/95a7f24583c7a04a9d1c4cdb2e7b3262.webm?t=1768965168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/ef8440a29b94a5da27116af4364342f5.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/ef8440a29b94a5da27116af4364342f5.webm?t=1768965168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRUST YOUR EARS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to spatial audio technology, you\u2019ll hear sounds not only left or right, but even as if someone is breathing down your neck. Sound goes beyond simple positioning: it realistically reflects off surfaces and becomes distorted as it filters through thin barriers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hired professional actors to voice all characters to help you fully immerse in the game\u2019s atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio in this game is not just sound \u2014 it\u2019s the foundation of the gameplay. Most challenges are based on auditory perception, from straightforward navigation to modest puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/1804e75569907abdce2d99624a064e33.gif?t=1768965168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/1804e75569907abdce2d99624a064e33.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/cda5604726539e64fd1c0fbcc48b463c.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" width=640 height=107 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/cda5604726539e64fd1c0fbcc48b463c.webm?t=1768965168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/133a9a57ec04da7844c6a7e689e1c69a.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/133a9a57ec04da7844c6a7e689e1c69a.webm?t=1768965168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HE\u2019S NEARBY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the dark. The antagonist is always close and SEES you. He can catch you at any moment\u2026 but he doesn\u2019t rush. He wants to play, to frighten you, to break you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect intense chase sequences that will test your spatial awareness and your hearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings: your first playthrough won\u2019t be the last \u2014 pay attention to unlock the alternate ending. Can you stand up to the stalker?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/1804e75569907abdce2d99624a064e33.gif?t=1768965168\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/1804e75569907abdce2d99624a064e33.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYTIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is Anybody There? is a short but tightly packed horror experience \u2014 a full playthrough takes about 60\u2013120 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/f83332fb8cdcd74842da34b3676b83dc.poster.avif?t=1768965168\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953710/extras/f83332fb8cdcd74842da34b3676b83dc.webm?t=1768965168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Red Oni Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indi